{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1129431-trinity-at-gen-con-50","id":1129431,"title":"Trinity at Gen Con 50!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-15T14:25:10-07:00","id":1129431,"title":"Trinity at Gen Con 50!","content":"Hey, everyone. Here's what we're doing for <i>Trinity</i> at Gen Con 50.<br /> <br /> <b>Panel</b><br /> <br /> On Saturday, at 11 AM, at the Crowne Plaza hotel, in Pennsylvania Station B, we'll be hosting a panel for <i>Trinity</i> and <i>Scion</i>. We'll be talking about future plans, as well as answering your questions.<br /> <br /> <b>Booth</b><br /> <br /> Developer Ian, art director Mike, and other members of the team will be at our booth throughout the show to chat about <i>Trinity</i>. We'll also have a special Storypath system preview featuring <i>Trinity</i>, along the lines of the one for <i>Scion</i> from last year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T06:16:32-07:00","id":1130788,"title":"","content":"I wish I could make it this year. Please post a transcript!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-21T23:04:48-07:00","id":1132514,"title":"","content":"Was anyone at the panel and able to report on it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-25T15:07:20-07:00","id":1133955,"title":"","content":"Did nobody see the panel?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-26T12:28:39-07:00","id":1134219,"title":"","content":"i was at the panel. i missed the very beginning (had a long walk) but the important gist was they expect the trinity KS in early 2018. i didn't hear anything else there that i recalled as being new information. the one thing i wanted to ask and didn't get a chance to was if the KS would include aeon or just the modern setting. they did give a lot more detail about the modern setting, so that might have been new, and had some new artwork in the pamphlet. if people are interested and its kosher, i can scan that for people, as its got some storypath rules and aeon setting, and some nice art.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4941-cielago","name":"Cielago","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4941_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-26T19:18:35-07:00","id":1134325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cielago</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1129431-trinity-at-gen-con-50?p=1134219#post1134219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i was at the panel. i missed the very beginning (had a long walk) but the important gist was they expect the trinity KS in early 2018.</div> </div> </div> </div>End of 2017, likely.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> i didn't hear anything else there that i recalled as being new information. the one thing i wanted to ask and didn't get a chance to was if the KS would include aeon or just the modern setting. </div> </div> </div>Like Scion, it's both books.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> they did give a lot more detail about the modern setting, so that might have been new </div> </div> </div>I didn't cover anything new at the panel. People can relax.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> and had some new artwork in the pamphlet. if people are interested and its kosher, i can scan that for people, as its got some storypath rules and aeon setting, and some nice art. </div> </div> </div>It's on DriveThruRPG, linked in last week's <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/now-available-lily-sabre-and-thorn-and-our-2017-2018-brochures/\" target=\"_blank\">release post</a>. No need to scan.<br /> <br /> It's the same as last year's Storypath brochure, just with a Trinity skin instead of Scion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-28T05:26:03-07:00","id":1134807,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the update Ian!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://fo